  _phoneDialogueMorning:
    _sentences:
    - Heya pal, good afternoon!
    - I came back this morning to grab some more stuff, and I found you clutching
      the camera in your sleep, silly!
    - 'I tried to wake you up, but you slept right through it...You better be careful,
      or you''ll sleep the whole day away! '
    - 'I''ll come grab you sometime, but can you do me a favor and take some more
      pictures first? '
    - 'We can''t just leave our junk behind, can we? Anyways, left my camera on the
      kitchen table downstairs. '
    - Think of this like a chance to stay a bit longer. I'll call again later to
      check on you- have fun pal!
  _evidence: {fileID: 1964211140}
